1 NOTE {geni:about_me} “Danny” was an assistant hockey coach with the Bronks before serving as Stoker First Class in RCNVR during WW II. At the Comox base on Vancouver Island, BC, he met and married Jane and they bought property west of 
2 CONC what is now Sarcee Trail on Old Banff Coach Road in Calgary. Before the city expropriated it, Danny and Jane lived there with 3 children, horses, dogs and an assortment of Cadillac’s. John Darrell, Patrick Beverly and Judy were th
2 CONC e children and each helped a bit with Danny's office furniture store. Danny lived with with zest!
